{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everybody find your seats- <strong>EPISODE 4</strong> is ready to take the stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Episode 4 Part 1:</u>\u00a0<strong>Detective Petty Puddles and the Case of the Dead Guy on a Train</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel up Mt. Hyup on train packed full of emo fans and death metal superstars. But when the most famous frontman in Maddox is murdered in the middle of the night, there's only one petty who can bring the killer to justice.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Episode 4 Part 2:</u><strong>\u00a0Tzino's Battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against prison musicians at the Mad Ox theater! The battle of the bands\u00a0finalist will take on Carungus and have a chance at stardom. But what chance do you have when your band's singer can barely speak?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in a battle of the bands against death metal band Carungus!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a murder mystery as Detective Petty Puddles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trains. Well, one train, but it's a satisfying amount of that one train.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most slammin' music Bossy can write.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faces, cards, eyeballs, and now vouchers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The new Muffles hat isn't technically a hat.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4020620?t=1757789322","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4020620?t=1757789322","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020620/da5af4663ab16d11b6021065617461317b026cae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757789322","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store